# Task 144-005: ADR-008 Cycle 2 Fix — core/session-interface.ts

## Problem Analysis

Döngüsel bağımlılık zinciri:
1. `core/provider.ts` → `import { Connector } from '../orchestra/connector.js'` (line 6)
2. `orchestra/connector.ts` → `import type { ProviderAdapter } from '../core/provider.js'` (line 6)
3. `providers/claude.ts` → `import { spawnWorker, ... } from '../orchestra/tmux.js'` (line 8-15)
4. `orchestra/tmux.ts` → `import type { ProviderAdapter } from '../core/provider.js'` (line 6)

ADR-008 violation: core/ → orchestra/ import (provider.ts → connector.ts).

## Solution Design

### Step 1: Move `Connector` and `HealthCheckResult` to `src/core/session-interface.ts`

`Connector` class ve `HealthCheckResult` interface'i core/'a taşınır:
- Connector'ın `ProviderAdapter` bağımlılığı aynı katmanda kalır (core/)
- orchestra/connector.ts → re-export from core/ (backward compat)

### Step 2: Update `provider.ts` import

`provider.ts` artık `Connector`'ı `./session-interface.js`'ten import eder (core/ internal).
`orchestra/connector.js` import'u kaldırılır.

### Step 3: Backward compatibility re-exports

`orchestra/connector.ts` → `export { Connector, HealthCheckResult } from '../core/session-interface.js'`
Mevcut importlar çalışmaya devam eder.

### Step 4: Tests

- `tests/core/session-interface.test.ts` — Connector ve HealthCheckResult için 12+ test
- Mevcut testlerin çalışmaya devam ettiğini doğrula

## Files Modified

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| src/core/session-interface.ts | NEW — Connector class + HealthCheckResult interface |
| src/core/provider.ts | UPDATE — import from ./session-interface.js |
| src/orchestra/connector.ts | UPDATE — re-export from core/session-interface.js |
| tests/core/session-interface.test.ts | NEW — 12+ tests |

## Risk Assessment

- LOW: Re-export pattern ensures all existing imports work unchanged
- Provider'lar hâlâ core/provider.ts'ten import ediyor (değişiklik yok)
- tmux.ts değişiklik gerektirmiyor
